            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 A site-to-site IPsec VPN must be used to secure traffic between the two sites;"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 The IKE identity on the new site gateway device must use the hostname option; and"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Internet traffic from each site should exit through its local Internet connection."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The configuration shown in the exhibit has been applied to the new site's SRX, but the secure tunnel is not working."
